    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb one-bedroom top-floor apartment with a sunny balcony overlooking the Camac River.\n\nThis stunning property is located on the top floor and features a welcoming entrance hall with cosy carpet flooring and a hot press. To the right of the hall is the bathroom, featuring tiled flooring, partially tiled walls and an electric shower. The spacious bedroom has laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and, like the rest of the property, has been freshly painted throughout. The open-plan living room, dining area and kitchen complete the property. The L-shaped kitchen features a tiled splashback, tiled flooring and a gas hob. The bright and light-filled living and dining area provides access to the sunny, generous balcony overlooking the Camac River, making it an ideal space to relax, unwind and entertain. The property is also serviced by a lift and further benefits from a designated secure underground parking space.\n\nCammock Purcell is a secure gated development ideally located in Mount Brown, just a short stroll from the new Children's Hospital at St. James's. The city centre is easily accessible by the Red Line LUAS and bus, making this a very convenient location. There are plenty of shops, cafés, bars and restaurants close by, with the Memorial Gardens, Phoenix Park and Royal Hospital Kilmainham also all within the surrounding area.\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 2003\nTop floor \nService charge 2484\nDesignated car space\nOpen plan\nTiled bathroom\nfitted wardrobe\nLaminate floors\nRiver views"
      },
